.RunControl
-----------

options for case control, phase definitions, CLI, and more

Aliases:
  * CAPEFile -> JSONFile
  * ConcurrentPythonFuncs -> WorkerPythonFuncs
  * ConcurrentShellCmds -> WorkerShellCmds
  * Continue -> ContinuePhase
  * GPU -> gpu
  * NSubProc -> Maxforks
  * NSubProcess -> MaxForks
  * PostCmds -> PostShellCmds
  * PostFuncs -> PostPythonFuncs
  * PostPyFuncs -> PostPythonFuncs
  * PreCmds -> PreShellCmds
  * PreFuncs -> PrePythonFuncs
  * PrePyFuncs -> PrePythonFuncs
  * Resubmit -> ResubmitNextPhase
  * WatcherCmds -> WorkerShellCmds
  * WatcherFuncs -> WorkerPythonFuncs
  * WatherTimeout -> WorkerTimeout
  * WorkerCmds -> WorkerShellCmds
  * WorkerFuncs -> WorkerPythonFuncs
  * WorkerMaxWaitTime -> WorkerTimeout
  * WorkerTimeOut -> WorkerTimeout
  * nJob -> NJob
  * sbatch -> slurm

Options:
  * Adaptive: whether or not to use ``aero.csh`` in phase [True | False]
  * BatchSize: number of iters to store in single batch [int]
  * ContinuePhase: whether restarts of same phase can use same job [True | False]
  * JSONFile: name of JSON file from which settings originated [str]
  * MPI: whether or not to run MPI in phase [True | False]
  * MaxForks: maximum forks to use for parallel post-processing [int]
  * MaxWorkers: maximum threads to use for parallel post-processing [int]
  * NJob: number of jobs to run concurrently [int]
  * PhaseIters: check-point iterations for phase *j* [int]
  * PhaseSequence: list of phase indices to run [int]
  * PhaseWatcherCmds
  * PhaseWatcherFuncs
  * PostPythonFuncs: Python functions to run after each cycle [list of dict | str]
  * PostShellCmds: list of commands to run after each cycle [list of dict | str]
  * PreMesh: option to generate mesh before submitting job [True | False]
  * PrePythonFuncs: Python functions to run before each cycle [list of dict | str]
  * PreShellCmds: list of commands to run before each cycle [list of dict | str]
  * RestartSamePhase: whether to restart same phase if needed [True | False]
  * ResubmitNextPhase: whether new job submits at end of phase [True | False]
  * ResubmitSamePhase: whether same-phase repeats need new job [True | False]
  * RootDir: (absolute) base folder from which CAPE settings were read [str]
  * StartNextPhase: whether to start next phase or stop CAPE [True | False]
  * Verbose: "RunControl" verbosity flag [True | False]
  * WarmStart: whether to warm start a case [True | False]
  * WarmStartFolder: folder from which to get warm-start file [str]
  * WarmStartPhase: phase from which to warm-start a case [int]
  * WorkerPythonFuncs: functions to run concurrently during phase [list of dict | str]
  * WorkerShellCmds: shell commands to run concurrently during phase [list of str]
  * WorkerSleepTime [int | float]
  * WorkerTimeout: max time to wait for workers after CFD phase [int | float]
  * ZombieFiles: file name flobs to check mod time for zombie status [list of str]
  * ZombieTimeout: minutes to wait before considering a case a zombie [int | float]
  * gpu: Whether to use GPU-version of code, if separate [True | False]
  * mpicmd: MPI executable name [str]
  * nIter: number of iterations to run in phase *j* [int]
  * nProc: number (or fraction) of cores to use (or omit if negative) [int | float]
  * qsub: whether or not to submit jobs with PBS [True | False]
  * quickstart: option to generate mesh before submitting job [True | False]
  * slurm: whether or not to submit jobs with Slurm [True | False]

Subsections:
  * .RunControl.Adaptation: Cart3D mesh adaptation overall control
  * .RunControl.Archive: options for archiving and file clean-up
  * .RunControl.Environ: environment variable settings
  * .RunControl.adjointCart: command-line options for ``adjointCart``
  * .RunControl.aflr3
  * .RunControl.autoInputs: CLI options for Cart3D ``autoInputs``
  * .RunControl.comp2tri: CLI options for ``comp2tri``
  * .RunControl.cubes: CLI options for Cart3D's ``cubes`` mesh generation executable
  * .RunControl.flowCart: command-line options for ``flowCart`` executable
  * .RunControl.intersect: CLI options for ``intersect``
  * .RunControl.mpi: options for MPI executable and command-line options
  * .RunControl.ulimit: options for ``ulimit`` environment settings
  * .RunControl.verify

